  "description": "This client library enables working with Microsoft.Data.SqlClient to connecto to MSSQL and with MySQL.Data to connect to MySQL.\n      It provides a unified interface for database operations, making it easier to switch between the two databases.\n      The library supports configuration through JSON files, allowing for easy management of connection strings and other settings.\n      It also includes support for dependency injection, making it easy to integrate into ASP.NET Core applications.\n      The library is designed to be lightweight and efficient, ensuring optimal performance for database operations.\n      The library is compatible with .NET 8.0 and is built using the latest features of the .NET framework.\n      The library is actively maintained and regularly updated to ensure compatibility with the latest versions of .NET and the underlying database drivers.",
